        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minipo</strong> is a fun and simple platform game designed for children.<br>In the game, you’ll join our character <i>Minipo</i> on exciting adventures across <strong>5 different worlds and 25 unique levels</strong>.<br>The difficulty increases gradually from easy to hard as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main goal is to reach the final level and <strong>reunite Minipo with his rabbit friends</strong>.<br>Of course, before that, you’ll face many challenges — <strong>water and fire obstacles, monsters, and evil mushrooms</strong> that will try to stop you.<br>But the game becomes even more fun along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most importantly, you can collect <strong>grapes, cherries, and apples</strong> to gain <i>fire power</i>.<br>With this fire power, you can defeat the monsters in the game!</p>",
